      "sourceTextSha256": "aa7be446a73545b4d605014b121cc40530c114fbe4dcd98f6f42e9c22d585ebf",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the Angra dos Reis region (about 3.5 hours from Rio)  \n\nA full-day trip on a private boat awaits you,  stopping  at the best beaches on the island. You will see unique landscapes! The Emerald Sea and many picturesque islets scattered around the bay. Very often you can see frolicking dolphins, giant fish, and turtles. In the sea, the schooner stops so that those who wish can swim.\n\nAfter that, you will be dropped off at the port of Angra dos Reis, where the driver will meet you and take you to Rio",
