    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "81e6c3575e4be7d9f03e7a6527f130c085c33aa8d7f073d2a8505784843bbac5",
      "text": "Time for optional tour\n\nBoat trip, ocean fishing, Botanical Garden walk, Tijuca Forest Tour, Modern and Historic Center Tour\n\nWe advise you to have a good rest and prepare for the New Year. \n\nIn the evening, an unforgettable holiday awaits you on the beach of Copacabana! New Year in Rio is a grand event not only for tourists, but also for locals.  It is launched on Copacabana beach from platforms located directly in the water. Residents of Brazil celebrate the New Year in white clothes. Believers pay tribute to the goddess of water Imanja. They put their gifts in tiny boats and send them to the ocean. And all this to the lights of fireworks falling into the water. The spectacle is truly mesmerizing! Also on the beach there are podiums for the performance of famous artists, who can be listened to this night by anyone - the concert is free! The fun continues all night. \n\nVIP New Year's Eve dinner in Belmond included.",
      "provenance": {
